# Line-ending policy.
#
# This machine runs Git for Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites LF
# to CRLF on checkout.  The build scripts are executed by WSL bash, where a
# trailing CR is a syntax error ("\r: command not found"), so they must be
# checked out with LF.  Windows-only scripts keep CRLF.
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
